{"id":"6175c327eb1421c302e2b83a976e0161be127525","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"6175c327eb1421c302e2b83a976e0161be127525","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/workspace-bin-repeat-install.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/deps.status\": patch","+\"@pnpm/workspace.state\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`pnpm install` now relinks the bins of a workspace package when its `bin` field changes, including with `--frozen-lockfile` and an unchanged lockfile. A filtered install relinks them in the selected projects, and the next install that covers the remaining projects relinks them there [pnpm/pnpm#17324](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/17324)."],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/main.rs","lines":["@@ -217,6 +217,7 @@ mod whoami;"," mod why;"," mod windows_dir_env;"," mod with;","+mod workspace_bins;"," mod workspace_cycles;"," mod workspace_install;"," mod workspace_path_overrides;"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/workspace_bins.rs","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,141 @@","+use assert_cmd::prelude::*;","+use command_extra::CommandExtra;","+use pnpm_testing_utils::bin::CommandTempCwd;","+use serde_json::{Value, json};","+use std::{fs, path::Path, process::Command};","+","+#[test]","+fn repeat_install_relinks_changed_workspace_bins() {","+    for linker in [\"isolated\", \"hoisted\"] {","+        for optimistic in [\"true\", \"false\"] {","+            assert_relinked_bins(linker, optimistic);","+        }","+    }","+}","+","+fn assert_relinked_bins(linker: &str, optimistic: &str) {","+    let fixture = workspace(linker, optimistic);","+    let root = &fixture.workspace;","+    for (bin, expected) in [","+        (Value::Null, vec![]),","+        (json!({\"a-one\": \"one.js\"}), vec![(\"a-one\", \"one\")]),","+        (json!({\"a-one\": \"one.js\", \"a-two\": \"two.js\"}), vec![(\"a-one\", \"one\"), (\"a-two\", \"two\")]),","+        (","+            json!({\"a-one\": \"two.js\", \"a-renamed\": \"one.js\"}),","+            vec![(\"a-one\", \"two\"), (\"a-renamed\", \"one\")],","+        ),","+        (json!(\"two.js\"), vec![(\"a\", \"two\")]),","+        (Value::Null, vec![]),","+    ] {","+        write_bins(root, &bin);","+        let lockfile = fs::read(root.join(\"pnpm-lock.yaml\")).ok();","+        let mut install = pnpm(root);","+        install.args([\"install\", \"--offline\", \"--ignore-scripts\"]);","+        if lockfile.is_some() {","+            install.arg(\"--frozen-lockfile\");","+        }","+        install.assert().success();","+        if let Some(lockfile) = lockfile {","+            assert_eq!(fs::read(root.join(\"pnpm-lock.yaml\")).unwrap(), lockfile);","+        }","+        for (name, output) in expected {","+            assert_bin(root, \"root\", name, output);","+        }","+    }","+    pnpm(root)","+        .args([\"install\", \"--offline\", \"--ignore-scripts\"])","+        .assert()","+        .success();","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn filtered_installs_keep_unselected_workspace_bins_stale() {","+    for linker in [\"isolated\", \"hoisted\"] {","+        let fixture = workspace(linker, \"true\");","+        let root = &fixture.workspace;","+        write_bins(root, &json!({\"a-one\": \"one.js\"}));","+        pnpm(root)","+            .args([\"install\", \"--offline\", \"--ignore-scripts\"])","+            .assert()","+            .success();","+        write_bins(root, &json!({\"a-one\": \"one.js\", \"a-two\": \"two.js\"}));","+        for consumer in [\"b\", \"c\", \"root\"] {","+            pnpm(root)","+                .args([","+                    \"--filter\",","+                    consumer,","+                    \"install\",","+                    \"--frozen-lockfile\",","+                    \"--offline\",","+                    \"--ignore-scripts\",","+                ])","+                .assert()","+                .success();","+            assert_bin(root, consumer, \"a-two\", \"two\");","+        }","+        pnpm(root)","+            .args([\"install\", \"--frozen-lockfile\", \"--offline\", \"--ignore-scripts\"])","+            .assert()","+            .success();","+        let state_path = root.join(\"node_modules/.pnpm-workspace-state-v1.json\");","+        let mut state: Value = serde_json::from_slice(&fs::read(&state_path).unwrap()).unwrap();","+        state[\"validation\"]","+            .as_object_mut()","+            .unwrap()","+            .remove(\"workspaceBins\");","+        fs::write(&state_path, state.to_string()).unwrap();","+        fs::remove_dir_all(root.join(\"node_modules/.bin\")).unwrap();","+        pnpm(root)","+            .args([\"install\", \"--frozen-lockfile\", \"--offline\", \"--ignore-scripts\"])","+            .assert()","+            .success();","+        assert_bin(root, \"root\", \"a-two\", \"two\");","+    }","+}","+","+fn workspace(linker: &str, optimistic: &str) -> CommandTempCwd<()> {","+    let fixture = CommandTempCwd::init();","+    let root = &fixture.workspace;","+    fs::write(","+        root.join(\"pnpm-workspace.yaml\"),","+        format!(\"packages:\\n  - packages/*\\nnodeLinker: {linker}\\noptimisticRepeatInstall: {optimistic}\\nverifyDepsBeforeRun: false\\n\"),","+    ).unwrap();","+    for (name, dir) in","+        [(\"root\", root.clone()), (\"b\", root.join(\"packages/b\")), (\"c\", root.join(\"packages/c\"))]","+    {","+        fs::create_dir_all(&dir).unwrap();","+        fs::write(","+            dir.join(\"package.json\"),","+            json!({\"name\": name, \"private\": true, \"dependencies\": {\"a\": \"workspace:*\"}}).to_string(","+            ),","+        )","+        .unwrap();","+    }","+    let package = root.join(\"packages/a\");","+    fs::create_dir_all(&package).unwrap();","+    for (file, output) in [(\"one.js\", \"one\"), (\"two.js\", \"two\")] {","+        fs::write(package.join(file), format!(\"#!/usr/bin/env node\\nconsole.log('{output}')\\n\"))","+            .unwrap();","+    }","+    fixture","+}","+","+fn write_bins(root: &Path, bin: &Value) {","+    fs::write(","+        root.join(\"packages/a/package.json\"),","+        json!({\"name\": \"a\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"bin\": bin}).to_string(),","+    )","+    .unwrap();","+}","+","+fn pnpm(root: &Path) -> Command {","+    Command::cargo_bin(\"pnpm\").unwrap().with_current_dir(root)","+}","+","+fn assert_bin(root: &Path, consumer: &str, name: &str, output: &str) {","+    pnpm(root)","+        .args([\"--filter\", consumer, \"--config.verify-deps-before-run=error\", \"exec\", name])","+        .assert()","+        .success()","+        .stdout(format!(\"{output}\\n\"));","+}"],"additions":141,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/package-is-installable/src/package_is_installable.rs","lines":["@@ -74,8 +74,8 @@ impl InstallabilityError {"," "," /// Tri-state verdict returned by [`package_is_installable`]."," ///","-/// - [`InstallabilityVerdict::Installable`]: no warning, no skip, just","-///   install.","+/// - [`InstallabilityVerdict::Installable`]: the package installs with no","+///   warning."," /// - [`InstallabilityVerdict::SkipOptional`]: the package is"," ///   incompatible and was declared optional; caller should emit"," ///   `pnpm:skipped-optional-dependency` and exclude the package from"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/package-manager/src/install/prepare_modules_state/up_to_date.rs","lines":["@@ -6,7 +6,11 @@ use super::super::{","     moved_tree_is_reusable, recorded_allow_builds_differ, unapproved_recorded_ignored_builds,","     update_workspace_state_or_warn, verify_lockfile_eagerly,"," };","-use crate::optimistic_repeat_install::{filesystem_now_ms_in_modules, materialized_shape_matches};","+use crate::optimistic_repeat_install::{","+    filesystem_now_ms_in_modules, materialized_shape_matches,","+    validation::{project_bins_digest, project_bins_match, wor